      "text": "Using the Compose tool in Pages, a user enters a prompt about writing a bedtime story about a 6-year-old named Annie who’s great at solving riddles."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2024/06/introducing-apple-intelligence-for-iphone-ipad-and-mac/#gallery-3516c2f76937164d0ae45c0a4df737e0",
      "text": "Using the Compose tool in Pages, a user accesses ChatGPT image tools to generate an image. The menu shows a range of styles suggested by ChatGPT: “Add a magical impressionist image,” “Add a photorealistic image of the story,” and “Include a backstory for the caterpillar.”"
